      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_02",
      "hash64": "794C3BF237DE32D5",
      "text": "联盟社的事……还有乌栗的事，\\n我都很感谢你。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_03",
      "hash64": "794C3AF237DE3122",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你当上冠军后，\\n乌栗就退出排行榜了。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_04",
      "hash64": "794C35F237DE28A3",
      "text": "虽然感觉有些寂寞，\\n但并不是就此见不到他了。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_05",
      "hash64": "794C34F237DE26F0",
      "text": "比起这个，纳莉我……\\n很开心看到他变回以前的样子。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_06",
      "hash64": "794C37F237DE2C09",
      "text": "我实在太开心了，\\n就调制了一大堆\\r\\n挑战时用的能飞的药丸。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_12",
      "hash64": "7948B1F237DB1280",
      "text": "想飞的时候就给小啊嘎嘶\\n适量吃点吧。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_01",
      "hash64": "0D2282BD495E0C0C",
      "text": "嘎嘶。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_02",
      "hash64": "0D2285BD495E1125",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_13",
      "hash64": "7948B2F237DB1433",
      "text": "呃，刚才……\\n该怎么说呢？不行。\\r\\n那样一次吃光的话……[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_03",
      "hash64": "0D2284BD495E0F72",
      "text": "啊嘎～嘶！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_system_01",
      "hash64": "1EA3E8AF2CA275D4",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n学会了坐骑招式：飞行！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_07",
      "hash64": "794C36F237DE2A56",
      "text": "总觉得……\\n它的力量好像更强了。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_08",
      "hash64": "794C41F237DE3D07",
      "text": "看样子它变得\\n可以随时飞行了？\\r\\n嗯，这样也好……[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_09",
      "hash64": "794C40F237DE3B54",
      "text": "我在飞翔计时赛\\n新设计了超级路线，\\r\\n对飞行技巧有自信的话，欢迎来试。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_10",
      "hash64": "7948B3F237DB15E6",
      "text": "完成飞翔计时赛的\\n高级路线后……\\c\\n还能挑战超级路线。\\n对飞行技巧有自信的话，欢迎来试。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_11",
      "hash64": "7948B4F237DB1799",
      "text": "……时间到，再见。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
